{'symbol': 'LW', 'date': '2019-09-25 22:30:00', 'title': 'LAMB WESTON HOLDINGS DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON NOVEMBER 29, 2019', 'text': 'THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF LAMB WESTON HOLDINGS, INC. DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.20 PER SHARE OF LAMB WESTON COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON NOVEMBER 29, 2019, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON NOVEMBER 1, 2019.'}